     134→### Game Restart Flow
     135→1. Game over detected in `Update()`
     136→2. `setGameOver(true)` called
     137→3. Main loop enters restart-wait loop (lines 186-197)
     138→4. User presses R → `reset()` called → game restarts
     139→5. User presses Esc/Ctrl+C → function returns, game exits
